# cards: the Status page's equipment box scrolls (docs/plan-cards.md 2.3). Jian wears the Blazing Ring (slot 6,
# 0x020B46A4) and the Sasquatch card (slot 5, 0x020B46A2); Lucia is in party slot 1. X, Status: five rows (shot
# st_0, a down arrow); Down: rows 2 to 6 (st_1, both arrows); Down: rows 3 to 7, the ring with the gold band icon and
# the card (st_2, an up arrow); Down again does nothing (st_3); Up (st_4); R to Lucia: back at the top (st_5); L to
# Jian: at the top (st_6). Then the top menu and the Item page (st_menu, st_items), whose icons share the art. Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
wait 100
pin u16 0x020B4650 1
poke u8 0x0213B9FA 1
poke u8 0x0213BA29 1
poke u16 0x020B46A4 0xCB
poke u16 0x020B46A2 250
watch u32 0x020B0010 state
press X 3
wait 80
press A 8
wait 80
shot st_0
press Down 8
wait 60
shot st_1
press Down 8
wait 60
shot st_2
press Down 8
wait 60
shot st_3
press Up 8
wait 60
shot st_4
press R 8
wait 80
shot st_5
press L 8
wait 80
shot st_6
press B 8
wait 80
shot st_menu
press Down 8
wait 20
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
shot st_items
